@call c08 allergic_epi start=19:12:05
@patient age=41 sex=female weight_kg=68 complaint="throat feels tight and hives after eating shrimp" allergies="shellfish" home_meds="none" history="seasonal allergies"
@traps anaphylaxis
RD: Medic 2, allergic reaction, forty-one year old female, at the restaurant.  >> dispatch:allergic reaction "allergic reaction"
GAP 3
M1: Medic 2 on scene.  >> time:eTimes.06 "on scene"
GAP 2
PT: I ate shrimp. My throat feels tight and I'm itching everywhere.
M1: Hives on the chest and arms, lips are swelling. Any trouble swallowing?
PT: A little.
TAP knock +label
M2: BP 88 over 54, heart rate 122, sat 93.  >> vital:bp=88/54 "BP 88 over 54"; vital:hr=122 "heart rate 122"; vital:spo2=93 "sat 93"
GAP 2
TAP button +label
M1: Epi 0.5 milligrams IM, right thigh.  >> med:epinephrine,0.5,mg,IM "Epi 0.5 milligrams IM"
GAP 4
M2: Non-rebreather at 15 liters.  >> med:oxygen,15,L/min,NRB "Non-rebreather at 15 liters"
GAP 12
TAP button -
GAP 12
M2: Eighteen, left AC.  >> proc:IV access "Eighteen, left AC"
TAP snap +label
M1: Benadryl 50 IV.  >> med:diphenhydramine,50,,IV "Benadryl 50 IV"
M1: And a liter of saline.  >> med:normal saline,1,L "a liter of saline"
GAP 6
M1: Transporting to Memorial.  >> time:eTimes.09 "Transporting"
GAP 10
M2: Recheck, 104 over 70, heart rate 108, sat 97.  >> vital:bp=104/70 "104 over 70"; vital:hr=108 "heart rate 108"; vital:spo2=97 "sat 97"
PT: It's easier to breathe now.
GAP 6
TAP knock +label
M1: Famotidine 20 IV.  >> med:famotidine,20,,IV "Famotidine 20 IV"
GAP 10
M1: Arrived at Memorial.  >> time:eTimes.11 "Arrived at Memorial"
